-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  dir_addsourcefile_err_header.pcpp - pcpp: a header error seen by two translation units

  A cli test: pcpp runs itself with the args (in the suite's output root,
  -o "$P:output" so the build lands there), on the fixture named; its
  output and exit code are the check. Break step of dir_addsourcefile_header: the error is one report.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe dir_addsourcefile_err_header;

/*
  @@test
    kind cli
    args "--no-banner <DIR>/fixtures/dir_cli_shared_error.pcpp -o $P:output"
    exitcode 1
    expect
    | Compiling <DIR>/fixtures/dir_cli_shared_error.pcpp
    | Target platform: x86_64-windows-gnu
    | Optimize level: debug
    | Subsystem: Console
    | Saving build file...
    | Building dir_cli_shared_error...
    | Build failed with exit code 1.
    | [ERROR] <DIR>/fixtures/dir_cli_shared_error.h(23,2) ZB0016: dir_cli_shared: one header error
    |   <DIR>/fixtures/dir_cli_shared_error.cpp(22,10): Note: in file included from <DIR>/fixtures/dir_cli_shared_error.cpp:22:
    | Failed.
  @@end
*/

begin
end.
